# Keep local credentials and dependency/build output out of the Docker context.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
